This patch replaces the timed_delay boolean option with delay-option,
and tells how many milliseconds to wait between certain screen updates.

This affects things like thrown or fired weapons, visible zaps, camera
flash and sparkle.

You can define the delay either in your config file, or in the game.
eg.

OPTIONS=delay:20

The default delay is 50 milliseconds.

This is only for TTY, and I've only tested it on linux.  The patch
also breaks savefile compat. (Though it wouldn't be hard to make
a version that didn't break compat)

